  "description": "The RUUT AL2 is a great entry-level all-rounder. With a nice price and killer looks it’s the perfect choice for a winter training bike, commuter, or for your first gravel bike. Built around a light and tough alloy frame, the components have been chosen and tested for reliability. Some of the highlights include powerful SRAM hydraulic brakes, a full carbon fork, and a reliable 1x11 drivetrain. We guarantee you will also love the WTB Nano tyres which not only roll well on smooth, dry surfaces, but provide unparaleled support in wet and muddy conditions. With it's responsive ride, clean internal cable routing and an absolutely jaw dropping paint job, the Ruut AL2 Citron is bound to make your day better.",
